    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Belief: A God's Burden is an exploration and combat-focused top-down open-world RPG set up in a grim and dark city with procedurally generated dungeons underneath, where the player takes the role of a powerful demigod created from their believers' faith and wish for freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/46f782169cdc1e4cd68e8ed081beaab8.avif?t=1749574675\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of An\u2019D\u00f3mun was once blessed with the teachings from the Reisendderi, godly entities sent to earth by M\u2019othair Segen to guide humanity and protect the world from destruction, but for centuries, since the last time one of those graced the world, the world has fallen on the hands of an evil force: Lyharkie, a vile entity that threatens to corrupt and destroy all of civilizations from within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/a2c3f2b7b307121ff72ca3cf1857c346.avif?t=1749574675\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/ac8845f34cc13a710e492b916ef3a6cf.poster.avif?t=1749574675\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/ac8845f34cc13a710e492b916ef3a6cf.webm?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/ac8845f34cc13a710e492b916ef3a6cf.mp4?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last of the Reisendderi, explore the decaying city of Nova L\u00famen, a place once sacred for the Tuatha, an ancient culture that resists extinction. Help your devotees survive this harsh reality and get involved in their stories, conflicts, and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/26e2523cabd3259f9704447b7f5c8a1d.poster.avif?t=1749574675\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/26e2523cabd3259f9704447b7f5c8a1d.webm?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/26e2523cabd3259f9704447b7f5c8a1d.mp4?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/081327824b32db47ad8fb4790b19c246.avif?t=1749574675\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nova L\u00famen, once a capital city rich in culture and knowledge, today lies under control of the terrible Lyharkie, which had transformed each sacred location for the Tuatha in perfect nests for her spawn, between Reality and the Immaterial, you are responsible for delving deep in their shapeless and ephemeral lairs to reach and defeat Lyharkie\u2019s seedlings to purify the many important locations for the Tuatha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/33d22853cf846c110a6f9eb943af0d56.poster.avif?t=1749574675\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/33d22853cf846c110a6f9eb943af0d56.webm?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/33d22853cf846c110a6f9eb943af0d56.mp4?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/ba9beee6d06ca81b7873884b327791eb.avif?t=1749574675\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore dungeons and help the people of Nova L\u00famen, you unlock more power to your arsenal, offering new ways to combine them to use in combat and adapt to any play style. With four equipment slots to customize before adventuring in a dungeon, between Tools that change your basic attacks, Blazes to modify your ultimate ability, Blasts which provide traversal options, and Souls that incentivize different playstyles with diverse passives, adding up to a wide range of more than 10 thousand possibilities to customize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Belief: A God's Burden is an exploration and combat-focused top-down open-world RPG set up in a grim and dark city with procedurally generated dungeons underneath, where the player takes the role of a powerful demigod created from their believers' faith and wish for freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/46f782169cdc1e4cd68e8ed081beaab8.avif?t=1749574675\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of An\u2019D\u00f3mun was once blessed with the teachings from the Reisendderi, godly entities sent to earth by M\u2019othair Segen to guide humanity and protect the world from destruction, but for centuries, since the last time one of those graced the world, the world has fallen on the hands of an evil force: Lyharkie, a vile entity that threatens to corrupt and destroy all of civilizations from within.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/a2c3f2b7b307121ff72ca3cf1857c346.avif?t=1749574675\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/ac8845f34cc13a710e492b916ef3a6cf.poster.avif?t=1749574675\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/ac8845f34cc13a710e492b916ef3a6cf.webm?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/ac8845f34cc13a710e492b916ef3a6cf.mp4?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the last of the Reisendderi, explore the decaying city of Nova L\u00famen, a place once sacred for the Tuatha, an ancient culture that resists extinction. Help your devotees survive this harsh reality and get involved in their stories, conflicts, and mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/26e2523cabd3259f9704447b7f5c8a1d.poster.avif?t=1749574675\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/26e2523cabd3259f9704447b7f5c8a1d.webm?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/26e2523cabd3259f9704447b7f5c8a1d.mp4?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/081327824b32db47ad8fb4790b19c246.avif?t=1749574675\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nova L\u00famen, once a capital city rich in culture and knowledge, today lies under control of the terrible Lyharkie, which had transformed each sacred location for the Tuatha in perfect nests for her spawn, between Reality and the Immaterial, you are responsible for delving deep in their shapeless and ephemeral lairs to reach and defeat Lyharkie\u2019s seedlings to purify the many important locations for the Tuatha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/33d22853cf846c110a6f9eb943af0d56.poster.avif?t=1749574675\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/33d22853cf846c110a6f9eb943af0d56.webm?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/33d22853cf846c110a6f9eb943af0d56.mp4?t=1749574675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680950/extras/ba9beee6d06ca81b7873884b327791eb.avif?t=1749574675\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore dungeons and help the people of Nova L\u00famen, you unlock more power to your arsenal, offering new ways to combine them to use in combat and adapt to any play style. With four equipment slots to customize before adventuring in a dungeon, between Tools that change your basic attacks, Blazes to modify your ultimate ability, Blasts which provide traversal options, and Souls that incentivize different playstyles with diverse passives, adding up to a wide range of more than 10 thousand possibilities to customize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
